{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc32c3c348d6745ec73ced24cab1b821bfa649bf1d14fb420ae7094c336d2f01", "ja": "（エレナたちのリハーサルは、無事に終わった。\n後は、本番を迎えるのみだ）", "zh": "（艾琳娜她们顺利结束排练了。\n接下来就是正式开演了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c0479a8533e35bec56c686d2b635f97de8ae878efa27208cdf81c0d48fc50d7d", "ja": "{$P$}！\nワタシ、気づいちゃったヨー！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我发现了一件事唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "21ae803d66acf17506c7832fe694e05bc3a2370f7d3adfdc532296343c479a06", "ja": "どうしたんだ、エレナ。\n気づいたって……何に？", "zh": "怎么啦，艾琳娜？\n你说发现……是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "d442bd61294bf260a83df1341f842f585473a31ee40a81873bcdce2e126d92d0", "ja": "あのネ、ステージセットに、\nお星さまが3つ浮かんでるでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊，在舞台布景上\n有三颗星星挂在空中不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1aec223252fe2b9bf7dd4f64861abe6246d2aa735a94f2dfb9d79133b8bcff7", "ja": "あれって、もしかしてワタシたちのこと？\nコトハとメグミと、エレナ……。", "zh": "那个，该不会是代表我们？\n琴叶、惠美还有艾琳娜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "225157bb5d55a1b2c5d55e1fb65a4b797b553781c118fba944d81313bf7235e4", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。エレナと琴葉、恵美を\n星に例えてるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，没错喔，星星就是用来\n代表艾琳娜、琴叶还有惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "709d0d06f91ba2db97d5f89b941480b1c66ecdae52ddc311b72b3e0f1d46cd8b", "ja": "やっぱりー！　エヘヘ……。\n偶然だけど、なんかうれしいヨー♪", "zh": "果然是这样──！嘿嘿……\n虽然是巧合，但人家好开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6b9ff6998fe7a30684f96eafad2f00c39fbcdda06ff0b971b5942e6d95beed83", "ja": "偶然？", "zh": "巧合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "ae76eb58a36f9c197d69262dab15e4fe2accf9e7c0e94b4761f1f8bb0025f2c6", "ja": "昨日、露天風呂で星を眺めながら、\nコトハとメグミと話してたんだヨ。", "zh": "昨天泡着露天温泉在看星星的时候，\n我跟琴叶还有惠美正好聊到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "82b49599bcef0c59acbd709dfdb4d230e16fc8317e3975b1904c65c69692cc68", "ja": "たくさんの星の中にネ、3つ並んだ星があったノ。\nそれで、ワタシたちみたいだネって……。", "zh": "在点点繁星里头，有三颗星星排在一起。\n这三颗星星就像我们一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9245398e5295a7609198e16f9e9dfce0877d860de09610d40d673d6520e93f20", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n……3人とも、ツアー以外でも楽しめたみたいだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n……看来你们除了巡演之外也过得很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd99893b1e3518cc79612c894209e1a64b7144ea3c7749a546b6f87ddc319dd8", "ja": "うん！　露天風呂はとっても気持ちよかったし、\n星はキレイだったし、楽しかったヨー。", "zh": "嗯！露天温泉非常舒服，\n星星也很美，超级开心的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "6b0b3f9e8d9c20fd37c2ee02fe02c6454bfb7b67d23beb5fba85a500eaff6d45", "ja": "{$P$}も、一緒に入れたら\nよかったネ。ひとりぼっちで、寂しかったでしょ？", "zh": "要是{$P$}也一起来泡就好了。\n你自己一个人，肯定很寂寞对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "32238fb4b6469f3a0d69f7a2b621205eef013a99db6e0649a08236472a3483da", "ja": "心配してくれてありがとう。\nけど、流石に一緒には入れないからな。", "zh": "谢谢你的关心。\n但再怎么说，要一起泡是不可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "c0bb119f9578aa64b7adfe370e0a5034769a3ed5138fd6f8b867ff882cad8d02", "ja": "残念だナー。あ、でも{$P$}が\n寂しくならないように、決めておいたヨ！", "zh": "太可惜了～啊，不过为了不让{$P$}\n感到寂寞，我们做了一个决定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0d8e0c299720ef0bec1ac8ca37965380c7a23cd4bcf3791ad5dd79a8f48fcf82", "ja": "決めておいた？", "zh": "做了一个决定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "cff77583173471d9cf8070b9fdd50ba301d6f483536fd400ecc6316f13e63d51", "ja": "お星さま！　3つのお星さまの近くに、\n大きなお星さまがあったノ。", "zh": "就是星星！在三颗星星的旁边，\n有一颗特别大的星星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "755d492b9e2fb22df19c2e0e10882af06fac07f8ac81dc564d61c2de4a863d7d", "ja": "あれは{$P$}だネって、\n3人で話したんだヨ♪　だから、みんな一緒だネ！", "zh": "我们三个人觉得，那个就是{$P$}♪\n所以，大家都在一起喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a7d61f3ab7419ec653990d8da1a72518a98d5ee4afd41f20a3598e6be33b3a4a", "ja": "はは、それは嬉しいな。ありがとう！\n改めて、みんなと繋がれた気がするよ。", "zh": "哈哈，真高兴你们这么想，谢谢啦！\n这让我再次觉得自己跟你们是相连的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "d8736bb0416792ee112aae7e3584ed8ee6b991b34b21701f68d8b566d8aed2af", "ja": "エヘヘ。一緒のお風呂に入れなくても、\nこれでもう寂しくないよネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样就算不能一起泡温泉，\n也不会感到寂寞对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "4fd3f53c3d1c722f516973c6bec53db875e03afad5cfc4e354271e9ba9bf7d64", "ja": "あっ……コトハとメグミが呼んでるみたい。\n{$P$}、またあとでネ！", "zh": "啊……琴叶跟惠美好像在叫我了。\n{$P$}，等会见喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0124_1021_p", "source_sha256": "322ec9aeec7b527c507844a8148a2a1294212cf5df7a1e89119b1b28d5f650bb", "ja": "（エレナという星は、まっすぐに駆けていく。\nその心と輝きは、お客さんにも届くはずだ……！）", "zh": "（艾琳娜这颗星星，笔直地飞奔而去。\n相信观众们一定能感受到她的内心和光芒……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
